 *
 * The ore dictionary is gone, its keys (e.g. "ingotUranium") are mapped to item tags by {@link #tag(String)}
 * (c:ingots/uranium). The DictFrame getters still return the original keys so recipe code can be ported as is.
 * Hazards of materials are registered on those tags.
 */
@SuppressWarnings("unused")
public class OreDictManager {

